  "reasoning": "The lecture moves from the complete VR-system view to the user-hardware data flows, then to the role of the physical environment, then to the main hardware categories, and then to input devices. I cut at the lecturer's clear bridges at sentences 29, 42, 69, 84, 187, and 219, where a new component, interaction, environment, hardware list, input type, or closing recap is introduced. Opening remarks stay in the first segment, the final recap/preview is kept as its own closing segment, and each segment names enough context to stand alone.",
  "segments": [
