      "start": 1,
      "subgoal": "Describe the complete view of a VR system as including the user/organism, VR hardware, and physical environment, rather than only hardware."
    },
    {
      "start": 29,
      "subgoal": "Explain how stimulation and tracking data flows connect VR hardware with the user, and what kinds of user actions may be tracked."
    },
    {
      "start": 42,
      "subgoal": "Explain why the surrounding physical environment belongs to the VR system and how the user and hardware can change or be affected by it."
    },
