      "start": 69,
      "subgoal": "Identify the three main categories of VR hardware: display/output, sensor/input, and computer/processing."
    },
    {
      "start": 84,
      "subgoal": "Describe the categories of hand-based VR input devices, their examples, and their advantages and limitations."
    },
    {
      "start": 187,
      "subgoal": "Describe non-hand-based VR input devices such as head tracking and eye tracking, and explain the Midas touch problem and why multimodal input is preferred."
